File name: POOLLOOP.MP
Path description: Salamander tubes, plus small part of lava fields.
Path starts: Lava Pool
Path ends: ---
Area of the game: Module 4
Level recommendation: 30-40
Type of path: Loop
File format: New
Monsters encountered: salamander, magma man, greater hellhound, others.
Additional information:

You need a magma amulet for this loop.

This loop goes through the salamander tubes, and a small area outside of
them (in the lava fields), which is benefical if you're maxing out the
regen in the tubes.
